  "description": "CR 205.1b, 611.2c, 613.4b, 613.4c: Ride the Shoopuf's landfall puts a +1/+1 counter on a creature its controller controls, and its activation makes it a 7/7 Beast creature that stays an enchantment and outlives the turn",
